string.text:
Among the many pages of obscure terminology, diagrams, and barely legible illustrations, a typewritten sheet titled simply “Conclusion” stands out. 
“Based on the results of the review, the commission has concluded that: 
1) the project is still in the early stages of implementation; 
2) it is paramount that a method that combines the development of the mental abilities of the test subjects and the effective masking of the outer cortex radiation is created; 
3) it is recommended that the neuroengineering department is brought up to speed on the issue of the psychotronic overload for consultation purposes.”
